Due to this error , There are 2 issues arises.

Issue 1 : When launching the project there should be minimum amount [staked](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-vultisig/blob/main/src/ILOPool.sol#L274) (softcap) . But if some whitelisted claimRefund , then actual totalRaised should be reduced by raiseAmount but its not happened with current implementation, so still able to launch the project with less than [softcap](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-06-vultisig/blob/main/src/ILOPool.sol#L274).

