## Impact
Detailed description of the impact of this finding.

The Multicall contract allows multiple method calls within a single transaction using the multicall function. This functionality can be exploited to create a DOS attack by exhausting the gas limit.

If an attacker manages to exhaust the gas limit, it could prevent legitimate users from successfully executing transactions. This could disrupt the availability and reliability of the contract’s services.

